&lt;p&gt;Fight to survive an environment ravaged by a deadly pandemic as former outlaw biker, Deacon St. John.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Risk the threats of the Broken Road on the back of your trusty Drifter bike as you face terrifying hordes of relentless feral Freakers &amp;ndash; as well as dangerous gangs of humans.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unpredictable weather and different times of day and night can cause incredible danger and shocking surprises&amp;hellip; and everything wants you dead.&lt;/p&gt;
